# The assistant's model key. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill it in, or set the
# variable in your shell before running `npm run dev`.
#
# Nothing else in Ripple needs a key: every data source (Sentinel-2, Open-Meteo, USGS NWIS,
# Natural Earth, OpenFreeMap) is key-free by design. Without this variable the app runs
# exactly as it does with it, except that the assistant panel reports itself as not
# configured.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model. Defaults to `deepseek-flash`, which is the one that performs
# tool calls reliably; `deepseek-v4-pro` spends its completion budget reasoning and returns
# no tool calls.
# DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-flash
